     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INH 5 mg/kg (USU max 300 mg) PO daily. SE: rash, fever, hepatotoxicity, periph neuropathy, rarely anemia/agranulocytosis; safe in preg. Hepatitis risk higher if >35 y, EToH use dx, chronic liver dz, postpartum."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
